  "question_stem": "A fair four-sided spinner has edges numbered $1$, $2$, $2$, $3$. A fair three-sided spinner has edges numbered $-2$, $-1$, $1$. Each spinner is spun and the number on the edge on which it comes to rest is noted. The random variable $X$ is the sum of the two numbers that have been noted.",
